# Translation surface — optional, empty by default.
#
# One canonical markdown path per line. Listing a file here is a promise that it
# has a `.zh.md` and/or an `.es.md` sidecar, and that `scripts/check_translations.py`
# (run in CI too) will fail when one is missing, mislabelled, or older than the
# canonical file it translates.
#
# Nothing is listed today: the template is English-only and that is the intended
# state. Translate when a real reader needs it, not to look complete.
#
# To add one:
#   1. write `wiki/SCHEMA.zh.md`, first line:
#      <!-- translation: zh · canonical: wiki/SCHEMA.md · synced: 2026-11-14 -->
#   2. add `wiki/SCHEMA.md` below
#   3. python scripts/check_translations.py
#
# Do not list ledgers (`outputs/*/state.md`), the generated `wiki/index.md`, the
# append-only `wiki/log.md`, or `wiki/.page-template.md`: they change constantly,
# so a translation of them is guaranteed to be wrong within a week.

# The method and the rules
# README.md
# METHOD.md
# AGENTS.md
# CREDITS.md

# The wiki contract and the graph
# wiki/SCHEMA.md
# wiki/graph/README.md

# The outputs contract
# outputs/SPEC.md
# outputs/_template/SPEC.md
# outputs/linkedin/SPEC.md
# outputs/cv/SPEC.md

# The worked example
# docs/career/README.md
# docs/career/person.md
# docs/career/employer.md
# docs/career/position.md
# docs/career/decision-register.md
# docs/career/linkedin-draft-excerpt.md
# docs/career/source-cv-2026.md
